        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning for Mount Lofty Ranges forecast district</headline>
        <description>
          Severe thunderstorms are likely to produce heavy rainfall that may lead to flash flooding in the warning area over the next several hours. Locations which may be affected include Coromandel East and Stirling.
          
          
          50.8 mm of rainfall recorded at Coromandel East in the 3 hours to 6:50 pm.
        </description>
        <instruction>The State Emergency Service advises that people should:
* Don't drive, ride or walk through flood water.
* Keep clear of creeks and storm drains.
* Stay indoors, away from windows, while storms are nearby.

</instruction>
        <web>http://www.bom.gov.au/australia/warnings</web>
